*Formula Sheet: Climate Physics & Reference Constants*

- *Radiation & Energy Balance:*
  $ S_0 = 1367 "W/m"^2, quad alpha_p approx 0.30 $
  $ T_e = (((1 - alpha_p) S_0) / (4 sigma))^(1/4) approx 255 "K" $
  $ Delta Q_"CO2" = 5.35 ln(r / r_0), quad "ECS" = - (Delta Q) / lambda $
  $ lambda_"Pl" = -4 epsilon tau_a sigma T_e^3 approx -3.36 "W/(m"^2"K)" $

- *Atmospheric & Fluid Dynamics:*
  $ p(z) = p_0 e^(- (g Delta z) / (R_d T)) $
  $ f = 2 Omega sin phi, quad arrow(U)_g = hat(k) times 1 / (f rho) bold(nabla) p $
  $ (dif e_s) / (dif T) = (l_v e_s) / (R_v T^2) $
